                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is another one of those super expensive Outright licensed games so if you own one or two you can probably deduce what this one will play like from the screenshots. It is a very basic 3D beat-em-up / brawler with a few different stages and bosses that you can pretty much blast through without much thinking. Graphically and gameplay wise it's not bad, I wish they added more uses for the other aliens because for about 90% of the game you can just spam Heatblast and mow everything in your way. If you can find the game at the right price and have an hour and a half or so to kill it's not bad. Oh and my Any% time is 48:23",
